  "name": "Reaching (Major)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This implement causes its spells to have farther reach.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Activate – Reach </strong><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Effect</strong> You increase the area of your next spell by the end of your turn. Its range increases by 30 feet. As normal for increasing ranges, if the spell normally has a range of touch, its range extends to 30 feet. The spell must have a casting time of <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> or <span class=\"action-glyph\">2 </span>actions, and must have a range. The spell must be of 1st to 9th rank.</p>"
    },
